+<main><section class="wrap hero" aria-labelledby="page-title"><span class="eyebrow">Simple, thoughtful pricing</span><h1 id="page-title">More connection.<br>Less overhead.</h1><p>Everything your team needs to have better conversations, without the noise or surprise fees.</p><fieldset class="billing" aria-label="Billing frequency"><legend class="sr-only" style="position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;padding:0;margin:-1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0);white-space:nowrap;border:0">Choose billing frequency</legend><label><input type="radio" name="billing" value="monthly" checked> Monthly</label><label><input type="radio" name="billing" value="yearly"> Yearly</label><span class="save">Save 20%</span></fieldset></section>
