+<section class="wrap section" id="compare" aria-labelledby="compare-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">At a glance</span><h2 id="compare-title">Find your fit</h2><p>Compare what’s included in every plan.</p></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><caption style="position:absolute;clip:rect(0,0,0,0)">Feature comparison for Relay plans</caption><thead><tr><th scope="col">Features</th><th scope="col">Free</th><th scope="col">Team</th><th scope="col">Business</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Message history</th><td>90 days</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Members</th><td>Up to 10</td><td>Unlimited</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Shared storage</th><td>5 GB</td><td>50 GB / person</td><td>Unlimited</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Audio &amp; video calls</th><td>1:1</td><td>Group</td><td>Group</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Apps and integrations</th><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes">✓</td><td class="yes">✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Single sign-on &amp; provisioning</th><td class="no">—</td><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes">✓</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Priority support</th><td class="no">—</td><td class="no">—</td><td class="yes">✓</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
+<section class="wrap section" aria-labelledby="faq-title"><div class="section-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Good to know</span><h2 id="faq-title">Frequently asked questions</h2><p>A few quick answers before you get started.</p></div><div class="faq"><details><summary>Can I try Relay before paying?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Absolutely. The Free plan is free forever, and you can start without a credit card. You can also try paid features with our team when you get in touch.</p></div></details><details><summary>How does yearly billing work?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Choose yearly billing to save 20% compared with paying month to month. The displayed per-person price is the monthly equivalent, billed annually.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can I change or cancel my plan?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Yes. You can upgrade, downgrade, or cancel at any time. When you change plans, we’ll make the transition straightforward and explain any prorated charges.</p></div></details><details><summary>What counts as a team member?</summary><div class="answer"><p>Each active person in your workspace counts as one member. Paid plans are priced per member, per month; guests and billing details can be discussed with our team.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do you offer help moving our team over?</summary><div class="answer"><p>We’re happy to help your team get settled. Business customers receive priority support, and any team can reach out to us for guidance.</p></div></details></div></section></main>
